    64	
    65	```bash
    66	curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/searchfn/index \
    67	  -H 'content-type: application/json' \
    68	  -d '{
    69	    "resource": "articles",
    70	    "documents": [
    71	      { "id": "a-1", "fields": { "title": "Hello SearchFn", "body": "Get started in 10 minutes" } },
    72	      { "id": "a-2", "fields": { "title": "BM25 in practice", "body": "Why ranking matters" } }
    73	    ]
    74	  }'
    75	```
